# The build context is the repository root, and everything in it is uploaded to
# the Docker daemon before the first instruction runs. Two reasons to be strict:
# .env carries the bot token and has no business leaving this directory, and the
# heavy directories below make every build slower for nothing.
.env
.env.*
.make.local

.git
.github
.claude
.vscode

frontend/node_modules
frontend/dist
frontend/test-results
frontend/playwright-report
backend/.venv
backend/static
backend/.e2e-data
backend/.pytest_cache
backend/.ruff_cache
backend/*.egg-info
**/__pycache__

# Runtime state and things only humans read.
data
preview
docs
*.md
LICENSE
